Write this week's Etsy shop coaching note.

Shop: {{ $json.shopName }}
Week ending: {{ $json.weekOf }}
Total active listings: {{ $json.totalListings }}

This week:
- Revenue: ${{ $json.current.revenue }}{{ $json.vsLastWeek.revenue !== null ? ' (' + ($json.vsLastWeek.revenue > 0 ? '+' : '') + $json.vsLastWeek.revenue + '% vs last week)' : '' }}
- Orders: {{ $json.current.orders }}{{ $json.vsLastWeek.orders !== null ? ' (' + ($json.vsLastWeek.orders > 0 ? '+' : '') + $json.vsLastWeek.orders + '% vs last week)' : '' }}
- Visits: {{ $json.current.visits }}{{ $json.vsLastWeek.visits !== null ? ' (' + ($json.vsLastWeek.visits > 0 ? '+' : '') + $json.vsLastWeek.visits + '% vs last week)' : '' }}
- Conversion rate: {{ $json.current.conversionRate }}%{{ $json.vsLastWeek.conversion !== null ? ' (was ' + ($json.current.conversionRate - ($json.vsLastWeek.conversion/100 * $json.current.conversionRate)).toFixed(2) + '% last week)' : '' }}
- Avg order value: ${{ $json.current.avgOrderValue }}
- Favorites added: {{ $json.current.favorites }}

4-week averages: ${{ $json.avg4.revenue }}/week revenue, {{ $json.avg4.orders }} orders/week

Top listings by views:
{{ $json.topListings.map(l => `- ${l.title}: ${l.views} views, ${l.orders} orders, ${l.conversion}% conversion, $${l.price}`).join('\n') }}

High views, zero orders this week ({{ $json.coldListings.length }}):
{{ $json.coldListings.map(l => `- ${l.title}: ${l.views} views, $${l.price}`).join('\n') || 'none' }}

Write the coaching note. Be specific about the actual numbers. Call out what's working and what isn't.

